---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { Profile } from '../data'
---
<BaseLayout
    className="PrivacyPage"
    title={`Privacy Policy | ${Profile.name}`}
    description="Privacy policy for luisjcenteno.dev"
>
    <article class="container mt-6">
        <h1 class="title is-1">Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p>
            <strong>Effective Date:</strong> October 2026
        </p>
        <p>
            This is the personal portfolio of <strong>{Profile.name}</strong>. It is a
            static website: there are no accounts, login forms, comments, or
            user-submitted content.
        </p>

        <h2 class="title is-4 mb-0">Information Collection</h2>
        <p>
            The site does not ask for or store personal information. Like most web
            servers, the hosting provider may record standard request data such as
            IP address, user agent, requested URL, and timestamp for security and
            operational purposes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="title is-4 mb-0">Analytics</h2>
        <p>
            This site uses Umami, a privacy-focused, cookieless analytics service, to
            understand aggregate page views and referrers. Umami does not use cookies
            and is not intended to identify individual visitors.
        </p>

        <h2 class="title is-4 mb-0">Cookies</h2>
        <p>
            This site does not set cookies. Third-party sites linked from this
            portfolio may set their own cookies under their respective policies.
        </p>

        <h2 class="title is-4 mb-0">External Links</h2>
        <p>
            Links to GitHub, project demos, and other external websites are provided
            for convenience. I am not responsible for the content or privacy practices
            of those sites.
        </p>

        <h2 class="title is-4 mb-0">Use of Information</h2>
        <p>
            Any operational data is used only to keep the site secure, diagnose
            problems, and understand aggregate traffic. It is not sold, traded, or
            used for advertising.
        </p>

        <h2 class="title is-4 mb-0">Data Protection</h2>
        <p>
            Reasonable security measures are used to protect the site and its
            infrastructure. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure,
            but no personal data is intentionally collected through this site.
        </p>

        <h2 class="title is-4 mb-0">Contact</h2>
        <p>
            Questions about this policy can be sent to
            <a href={`mailto:${Profile.email}`}>{Profile.email}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="title is-4 mb-0">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
            This policy may be updated if the site changes. Changes will be posted on
            this page with a new effective date.
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>{Profile.name}</strong>
        </p>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>
